artifacts:
  - $route/3.2.scenario.disentangle.correlation.anecdotes.yield.md

reviews:
  self:
    - slug: has-both-directions
      say: |
        did you compute BOTH forward P(effect|exposure) and backtrack
        P(exposure|effect)? one direction alone misreads the signal.
    - slug: has-upper-bound-flags
      say: |
        is every forward number flagged an upper bound (selection/problem-skew),
        never sold as a rate? an unflagged anecdote number invites overread.
    - slug: has-confounds-noted
      say: |
        are mixed-exposure cases flagged as confounds, not attributed to one
        exposure? a mixed case counted as clean signal corrupts the rank.
